{"id":"forecast-08","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-08/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":507.03,"segments":[{"start":5.55,"end":9.75,"text":"Part 4 You will hear a lecturer giving a talk on how","words":[["Part",5.55,6.07],["4",6.07,6.49],["You",6.49,7.41],["will",7.41,7.55],["hear",7.55,7.75],["a",7.75,7.99],["lecturer",7.99,8.39],["giving",8.39,8.75],["a",8.75,9.01],["talk",9.01,9.27],["on",9.27,9.53],["how",9.53,9.75]]},{"start":9.75,"end":16.59,"text":"science may change in the future. First you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40.","words":[["science",9.75,10.29],["may",10.29,10.57],["change",10.57,11.01],["in",11.01,11.17],["the",11.17,11.27],["future.",11.27,11.61],["First",12.53,13.01],["you",13.01,13.39],["have",13.39,13.53],["some",13.53,13.71],["time",13.71,14.01],["to",14.01,14.21],["look",14.21,14.41],["at",14.41,14.57],["questions",14.57,14.91],["31",14.91,15.83],["to",15.83,16.13],["40.",16.13,16.59]]},{"start":67.26,"end":71.36,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",67.26,67.56],["listen",67.56,67.88],["carefully",67.88,68.4],["and",68.4,68.82],["answer",68.82,69.2],["questions",69.2,69.66],["31",69.66,70.6],["to",70.6,70.96],["40.",70.96,71.36]]},{"start":74.66,"end":79.82,"text":"In this final lecture of our course on the history of science, I would like to look to","words":[["In",74.66,75.12],["this",75.12,75.42],["final",75.42,75.84],["lecture",75.84,76.34],["of",76.34,76.58],["our",76.58,76.74],["course",76.74,77.02],["on",77.02,77.36],["the",77.36,77.52],["history",77.52,77.78],["of",77.78,77.98],["science,",77.98,78.4],["I",78.86,79.08],["would",79.08,79.22],["like",79.22,79.36],["to",79.36,79.54],["look",79.54,79.66],["to",79.66,79.82]]},{"start":79.82,"end":85.6,"text":"the future and tell you about some predictions that have been made about scientific developments.","words":[["the",79.82,79.92],["future",79.92,80.32],["and",80.32,81.12],["tell",81.12,81.32],["you",81.32,81.5],["about",81.5,81.72],["some",81.72,82.02],["predictions",82.02,82.56],["that",82.56,83.02],["have",83.02,83.18],["been",83.18,83.34],["made",83.34,83.66],["about",83.66,84.2],["scientific",84.2,84.86],["developments.",84.86,85.6]]},{"start":85.6,"end":91.82,"text":"contents. The content for my talk is based on some research in which thirty scientific","words":[["contents.",85.6,85.8],["The",86.56,87.0],["content",87.0,87.44],["for",87.44,87.72],["my",87.72,87.88],["talk",87.88,88.14],["is",88.14,88.7],["based",88.7,88.96],["on",88.96,89.22],["some",89.22,89.44],["research",89.44,89.92],["in",89.92,90.56],["which",90.56,90.8],["thirty",90.8,91.32],["scientific",91.32,91.82]]},{"start":91.82,"end":98.08,"text":"leaders were invited to comment on the developments that they envisage as likely to come about","words":[["leaders",91.82,92.46],["were",92.46,92.7],["invited",92.7,93.1],["to",93.1,93.36],["comment",93.36,93.78],["on",93.78,94.44],["the",94.44,94.56],["developments",94.56,95.06],["that",95.06,95.46],["they",95.46,95.72],["envisage",95.72,96.44],["as",96.44,96.96],["likely",96.96,97.32],["to",97.32,97.54],["come",97.54,97.74],["about",97.74,98.08]]},{"start":98.08,"end":105.18,"text":"in their own discipline within fifty years. After summarizing some of their most interesting","words":[["in",98.08,98.64],["their",98.64,98.82],["own",98.82,99.22],["discipline",99.22,99.74],["within",99.74,100.36],["fifty",100.36,100.78],["years.",100.78,101.26],["After",102.1,102.76],["summarizing",102.76,103.54],["some",103.54,103.88],["of",103.88,104.06],["their",104.06,104.22],["most",104.22,104.48],["interesting",104.48,105.18]]},{"start":105.18,"end":110.94,"text":"contributions for you, I'll ask you to give me your opinions as to the likelihood of","words":[["contributions",105.18,105.7],["for",105.7,106.28],["you,",106.28,106.48],["I'll",106.92,107.28],["ask",107.28,107.58],["you",107.58,107.78],["to",107.78,107.88],["give",107.88,108.06],["me",108.06,108.28],["your",108.28,108.56],["opinions",108.56,109.1],["as",109.1,109.72],["to",109.72,109.88],["the",109.88,110.02],["likelihood",110.02,110.44],["of",110.44,110.94]]},{"start":110.94,"end":117.54,"text":"these changes occurring within this time scale. You may also like to suggest some other likely","words":[["these",110.94,111.18],["changes",111.18,111.74],["occurring",111.74,112.34],["within",112.34,112.96],["this",112.96,113.34],["time",113.34,113.64],["scale.",113.64,114.0],["You",114.88,115.26],["may",115.26,115.46],["also",115.46,115.76],["like",115.76,116.02],["to",116.02,116.18],["suggest",116.18,116.54],["some",116.54,116.9],["other",116.9,117.16],["likely",117.16,117.54]]},{"start":117.54,"end":118.56,"text":"changes yourselves.","words":[["changes",117.54,118.1],["yourselves.",118.1,118.56]]},{"start":120.0,"end":126.32,"text":"So first, let's start with computer science, as this is clearly an area where there are","words":[["So",120.0,120.38],["first,",120.38,120.7],["let's",121.16,121.66],["start",121.66,121.92],["with",121.92,122.24],["computer",122.24,122.86],["science,",122.86,123.42],["as",123.98,124.32],["this",124.32,124.54],["is",124.54,124.74],["clearly",124.74,125.12],["an",125.12,125.44],["area",125.44,125.74],["where",125.74,126.0],["there",126.0,126.18],["are",126.18,126.32]]},{"start":126.32,"end":132.66,"text":"bound to be dramatic developments, and even more significantly perhaps, these developments","words":[["bound",126.32,126.62],["to",126.62,126.84],["be",126.84,126.96],["dramatic",126.96,127.46],["developments,",127.46,128.1],["and",128.64,129.02],["even",129.02,129.7],["more",129.7,130.0],["significantly",130.0,130.7],["perhaps,",130.7,131.32],["these",131.84,132.16],["developments",132.16,132.66]]},{"start":132.66,"end":136.26,"text":"are likely to impact on every other field of learning.","words":[["are",132.66,133.0],["likely",133.0,133.38],["to",133.38,133.58],["impact",133.58,134.14],["on",134.14,134.52],["every",134.52,134.98],["other",134.98,135.3],["field",135.3,135.72],["of",135.72,135.92],["learning.",135.92,136.26]]},{"start":136.26,"end":144.16,"text":"The invention of computers represents an enormous leap forward in the field of human endeavor.","words":[["The",136.26,137.82],["invention",137.82,138.3],["of",138.3,138.6],["computers",138.6,139.24],["represents",139.24,140.22],["an",140.22,140.6],["enormous",140.6,141.18],["leap",141.18,141.74],["forward",141.74,142.28],["in",142.28,142.8],["the",142.8,142.94],["field",142.94,143.24],["of",143.24,143.4],["human",143.4,143.7],["endeavor.",143.7,144.16]]},{"start":144.68,"end":151.6,"text":"It could indeed be considered as being as momentous a development as when our predecessors in caves","words":[["It",144.68,145.14],["could",145.14,145.32],["indeed",145.32,145.64],["be",145.64,145.94],["considered",145.94,146.42],["as",146.42,146.9],["being",146.9,147.18],["as",147.18,147.46],["momentous",147.46,148.22],["a",148.22,148.4],["development",148.4,148.88],["as",148.88,149.58],["when",149.58,149.8],["our",149.8,150.0],["predecessors",150.0,150.66],["in",150.66,151.08],["caves",151.08,151.6]]},{"start":151.6,"end":155.84,"text":"first learned to make fire and use it for all sorts of purposes.","words":[["first",151.6,152.22],["learned",152.22,152.62],["to",152.62,152.88],["make",152.88,153.08],["fire",153.08,153.52],["and",153.52,154.06],["use",154.06,154.36],["it",154.36,154.52],["for",154.52,154.68],["all",154.68,154.98],["sorts",154.98,155.2],["of",155.2,155.42],["purposes.",155.42,155.84]]},{"start":156.92,"end":164.32,"text":"In the future, the computational revolution is certain to be generally recognized as a transformation","words":[["In",156.92,157.58],["the",157.58,157.74],["future,",157.74,158.18],["the",158.6,158.82],["computational",158.82,159.66],["revolution",159.66,160.44],["is",160.44,160.86],["certain",160.86,161.32],["to",161.32,161.56],["be",161.56,161.72],["generally",161.72,162.2],["recognized",162.2,162.92],["as",162.92,163.6],["a",163.6,163.76],["transformation",163.76,164.32]]},{"start":164.32,"end":168.7,"text":"as significant as, say, the Industrial Revolution.","words":[["as",164.32,165.02],["significant",165.02,165.7],["as,",165.7,166.18],["say,",166.46,166.84],["the",167.12,167.26],["Industrial",167.26,167.94],["Revolution.",167.94,168.7]]},{"start":169.68,"end":176.6,"text":"The computer scientists in the study I referred to felt that, in the coming decades, lives","words":[["The",169.68,170.16],["computer",170.16,170.66],["scientists",170.66,171.34],["in",171.34,171.92],["the",171.92,172.06],["study",172.06,172.38],["I",172.38,172.66],["referred",172.66,172.96],["to",172.96,173.4],["felt",173.4,173.88],["that,",173.88,174.2],["in",174.62,174.84],["the",174.84,174.96],["coming",174.96,175.2],["decades,",175.2,175.72],["lives",176.26,176.6]]},{"start":176.6,"end":183.5,"text":"will be significantly enhanced by automated reasoning systems of different types. There","words":[["will",176.6,176.88],["be",176.88,177.08],["significantly",177.08,177.8],["enhanced",177.8,178.66],["by",178.66,179.24],["automated",179.24,179.88],["reasoning",179.88,180.44],["systems",180.44,181.02],["of",181.02,181.42],["different",181.42,181.8],["types.",181.8,182.38],["There",183.16,183.5]]},{"start":183.5,"end":189.56,"text":"was considerable agreement that people will increasingly perceive these computer systems","words":[["was",183.5,183.82],["considerable",183.82,184.52],["agreement",184.52,185.42],["that",185.42,186.12],["people",186.12,186.46],["will",186.46,186.78],["increasingly",186.78,187.54],["perceive",187.54,188.3],["these",188.3,188.6],["computer",188.6,189.06],["systems",189.06,189.56]]},{"start":189.56,"end":195.46,"text":"systems as intelligent. Although many of these will be deployed behind the scenes, others","words":[["systems",189.56,189.7],["as",189.7,189.96],["intelligent.",189.96,190.72],["Although",191.84,192.18],["many",192.18,192.5],["of",192.5,192.68],["these",192.68,192.86],["will",192.86,193.06],["be",193.06,193.18],["deployed",193.18,193.54],["behind",193.54,194.0],["the",194.0,194.34],["scenes,",194.34,194.66],["others",195.2,195.46]]},{"start":195.46,"end":201.76,"text":"will be in the foreground, serving in an elegant, often collaborative manner to help people","words":[["will",195.46,195.72],["be",195.72,195.9],["in",195.9,196.04],["the",196.04,196.14],["foreground,",196.14,196.58],["serving",197.14,197.62],["in",197.62,197.92],["an",197.92,198.04],["elegant,",198.04,198.46],["often",198.9,199.26],["collaborative",199.26,199.9],["manner",199.9,200.58],["to",200.58,201.12],["help",201.12,201.38],["people",201.38,201.76]]},{"start":201.76,"end":207.62,"text":"do their jobs, to learn and teach, to reflect and remember, to plan and decide.","words":[["do",201.76,202.04],["their",202.04,202.24],["jobs,",202.24,202.7],["to",203.0,203.2],["learn",203.2,203.52],["and",203.52,203.74],["teach,",203.74,204.06],["to",204.44,204.62],["reflect",204.62,204.94],["and",204.94,205.2],["remember,",205.2,205.62],["to",206.12,206.28],["plan",206.28,206.74],["and",206.74,207.14],["decide.",207.14,207.62]]},{"start":208.62,"end":214.34,"text":"Without going into further detail about this at this point, let's turn to what prediction","words":[["Without",208.62,209.26],["going",209.26,209.66],["into",209.66,209.96],["further",209.96,210.24],["detail",210.24,210.78],["about",210.78,211.18],["this",211.18,211.48],["at",211.48,211.7],["this",211.7,211.88],["point,",211.88,212.2],["let's",212.6,213.04],["turn",213.04,213.3],["to",213.3,213.5],["what",213.5,213.76],["prediction",213.76,214.34]]},{"start":214.34,"end":222.08,"text":"psychologists had to make. Their key point was that psychological research would inevitably","words":[["psychologists",214.34,215.28],["had",215.28,215.84],["to",215.84,216.04],["make.",216.04,216.3],["Their",217.32,217.7],["key",217.7,218.04],["point",218.04,218.38],["was",218.38,219.02],["that",219.02,219.22],["psychological",219.22,219.8],["research",219.8,220.68],["would",220.68,221.24],["inevitably",221.24,222.08]]},{"start":222.08,"end":229.82,"text":"become increasingly varied. It would move into such areas as behavioral economics and social","words":[["become",222.08,222.68],["increasingly",222.68,223.44],["varied.",223.44,224.08],["It",224.9,225.14],["would",225.14,225.34],["move",225.34,225.6],["into",225.6,225.88],["such",225.88,226.08],["areas",226.08,226.52],["as",226.52,226.9],["behavioral",226.9,227.76],["economics",227.76,228.64],["and",228.64,229.34],["social",229.34,229.82]]},{"start":229.82,"end":235.28,"text":"neuroscience. There is likely to be further expansion into domains with more practical","words":[["neuroscience.",229.82,230.62],["There",231.48,231.86],["is",231.86,232.0],["likely",232.0,232.3],["to",232.3,232.44],["be",232.44,232.62],["further",232.62,232.84],["expansion",232.84,233.48],["into",233.48,233.78],["domains",233.78,234.24],["with",234.24,234.56],["more",234.56,234.78],["practical",234.78,235.28]]},{"start":235.28,"end":241.94,"text":"relevance as increasing numbers of women become research scientists, so areas such","words":[["relevance",235.28,235.96],["as",235.96,236.62],["increasing",236.62,237.1],["numbers",237.1,237.68],["of",237.68,237.96],["women",237.96,238.3],["become",238.3,238.98],["research",238.98,239.54],["scientists,",239.54,240.28],["so",240.76,241.08],["areas",241.08,241.44],["such",241.44,241.94]]},{"start":241.94,"end":247.38,"text":"as health, environment, family and social identity will receive more attention.","words":[["as",241.94,242.1],["health,",242.1,242.42],["environment,",242.78,243.28],["family",243.9,244.26],["and",244.26,244.62],["social",244.62,245.0],["identity",245.0,245.64],["will",245.64,246.26],["receive",246.26,246.68],["more",246.68,246.94],["attention.",246.94,247.38]]},{"start":248.68,"end":255.56,"text":"At the same time as they broaden their horizons, psychologists will also intensify their search","words":[["At",248.68,249.22],["the",249.22,249.36],["same",249.36,249.66],["time",249.66,249.98],["as",249.98,250.28],["they",250.28,250.44],["broaden",250.44,250.86],["their",250.86,251.14],["horizons,",251.14,251.86],["psychologists",252.26,252.9],["will",252.9,253.48],["also",253.48,253.96],["intensify",253.96,254.88],["their",254.88,255.14],["search",255.14,255.56]]},{"start":255.56,"end":262.52,"text":"to discover what exactly determines how we act. They will be assisted in this by imaging","words":[["to",255.56,255.78],["discover",255.78,256.24],["what",256.24,256.8],["exactly",256.8,257.5],["determines",257.5,258.18],["how",258.18,258.74],["we",258.74,258.98],["act.",258.98,259.46],["They",260.2,260.56],["will",260.56,260.74],["be",260.74,260.9],["assisted",260.9,261.32],["in",261.32,261.62],["this",261.62,261.84],["by",261.84,262.08],["imaging",262.08,262.52]]},{"start":262.52,"end":267.62,"text":"devices that will be inserted into the brain and provide a great deal of information","words":[["devices",262.52,263.12],["that",263.12,263.7],["will",263.7,263.86],["be",263.86,264.02],["inserted",264.02,264.5],["into",264.5,264.86],["the",264.86,264.98],["brain",264.98,265.34],["and",265.34,265.96],["provide",265.96,266.3],["a",266.3,266.52],["great",266.52,266.78],["deal",266.78,267.02],["of",267.02,267.16],["information",267.16,267.62]]},{"start":267.62,"end":273.8,"text":"about how it behaves. There should be some fascinating discoveries coming to light very soon.","words":[["about",267.62,268.06],["how",268.06,268.48],["it",268.48,268.6],["behaves.",268.6,269.06],["There",269.98,270.26],["should",270.26,270.5],["be",270.5,270.76],["some",270.76,270.98],["fascinating",270.98,271.6],["discoveries",271.6,272.28],["coming",272.28,272.68],["to",272.68,272.88],["light",272.88,273.1],["very",273.1,273.38],["soon.",273.38,273.8]]},{"start":279.05,"end":285.73,"text":"Another field that is currently undergoing enormous changes is that of genetics. It is","words":[["Another",279.05,279.49],["field",279.49,280.05],["that",280.05,280.29],["is",280.29,280.47],["currently",280.47,280.89],["undergoing",280.89,281.55],["enormous",281.55,282.11],["changes",282.11,282.73],["is",282.73,283.37],["that",283.37,283.59],["of",283.59,283.77],["genetics.",283.77,284.29],["It",285.31,285.57],["is",285.57,285.73]]},{"start":285.73,"end":291.63,"text":"not new to suggest that average life expectancy is likely to continue rising in most countries.","words":[["not",285.73,285.97],["new",285.97,286.23],["to",286.23,286.39],["suggest",286.39,286.79],["that",286.79,287.23],["average",287.23,287.69],["life",287.69,288.05],["expectancy",288.05,288.69],["is",288.69,289.05],["likely",289.05,289.37],["to",289.37,289.59],["continue",289.59,290.07],["rising",290.07,290.61],["in",290.61,290.91],["most",290.91,291.17],["countries.",291.17,291.63]]},{"start":292.37,"end":299.39,"text":"However, today geneticists emphasize that it is vital that the increasing number of the elderly","words":[["However,",292.37,292.93],["today",293.35,293.79],["geneticists",293.79,294.79],["emphasize",294.79,295.47],["that",295.47,296.15],["it",296.15,296.35],["is",296.35,296.53],["vital",296.53,296.95],["that",296.95,297.43],["the",297.43,297.61],["increasing",297.61,298.15],["number",298.15,298.59],["of",298.59,298.83],["the",298.83,298.99],["elderly",298.99,299.39]]},{"start":299.39,"end":307.39,"text":"in society must take quality of life into account. So how will genetics help this to happen?","words":[["in",299.39,299.67],["society",299.67,300.25],["must",300.25,300.93],["take",300.93,301.37],["quality",301.37,301.97],["of",301.97,302.27],["life",302.27,302.57],["into",302.57,302.95],["account.",302.95,303.37],["So",304.21,304.67],["how",304.67,305.13],["will",305.13,305.43],["genetics",305.43,305.91],["help",305.91,306.51],["this",306.51,306.85],["to",306.85,307.03],["happen?",307.03,307.39]]},{"start":308.59,"end":315.09,"text":"To start with, they hope to develop technologies that can sequence each person's genome extremely","words":[["To",308.59,309.05],["start",309.05,309.29],["with,",309.29,309.59],["they",309.99,310.05],["hope",310.05,310.29],["to",310.29,310.45],["develop",310.45,310.77],["technologies",310.77,311.61],["that",311.61,311.99],["can",311.99,312.21],["sequence",312.21,312.77],["each",312.77,313.23],["person's",313.23,313.89],["genome",313.89,314.35],["extremely",314.35,315.09]]},{"start":315.09,"end":322.97,"text":"cheaply. This information about our DNA enables healthcare providers to predict our likelihood","words":[["cheaply.",315.09,315.83],["This",316.77,317.15],["information",317.15,317.79],["about",317.79,318.25],["our",318.25,318.55],["DNA",318.55,319.09],["enables",319.09,320.07],["healthcare",320.07,320.65],["providers",320.65,321.31],["to",321.31,321.83],["predict",321.83,322.17],["our",322.17,322.57],["likelihood",322.57,322.97]]},{"start":322.97,"end":325.77,"text":"of suffering from any particular disease.","words":[["of",322.97,323.37],["suffering",323.37,323.85],["from",323.85,324.19],["any",324.19,324.53],["particular",324.53,325.15],["disease.",325.15,325.77]]},{"start":326.65,"end":330.51,"text":"From there on, it is a matter of weighing up various factors","words":[["From",326.65,326.97],["there",326.97,327.19],["on,",327.19,327.49],["it",327.89,327.95],["is",327.95,328.09],["a",328.09,328.21],["matter",328.21,328.45],["of",328.45,328.65],["weighing",328.65,329.17],["up",329.17,329.49],["various",329.49,329.93],["factors",329.93,330.51]]},{"start":330.51,"end":334.47,"text":"with a view to determining what can be done to minimize","words":[["with",330.51,331.27],["a",331.27,331.49],["view",331.49,331.71],["to",331.71,331.91],["determining",331.91,332.45],["what",332.45,333.09],["can",333.09,333.31],["be",333.31,333.49],["done",333.49,333.75],["to",333.75,333.97],["minimize",333.97,334.47]]},{"start":334.47,"end":336.97,"text":"each individual's level of risk.","words":[["each",334.47,335.07],["individual's",335.07,336.01],["level",336.01,336.31],["of",336.31,336.53],["risk.",336.53,336.97]]},{"start":338.09,"end":342.71,"text":"With such information in hand, new treatments will be developed","words":[["With",338.09,338.55],["such",338.55,338.87],["information",338.87,339.57],["in",339.57,340.05],["hand,",340.05,340.57],["new",341.09,341.29],["treatments",341.29,341.71],["will",341.71,342.09],["be",342.09,342.27],["developed",342.27,342.71]]},{"start":342.71,"end":346.99,"text":"and the current one-size-fits-all approach to health care","words":[["and",342.71,343.41],["the",343.41,343.55],["current",343.55,343.87],["one",343.87,344.45],["-size",344.45,344.83],["-fits",344.83,345.23],["-all",345.23,345.65],["approach",345.65,346.13],["to",346.13,346.39],["health",346.39,346.61],["care",346.61,346.99]]},{"start":346.99,"end":349.67,"text":"will give way to a more personal approach.","words":[["will",346.99,347.47],["give",347.47,347.71],["way",347.71,347.97],["to",347.97,348.17],["a",348.17,348.31],["more",348.31,348.51],["personal",348.51,349.11],["approach.",349.11,349.67]]},{"start":350.97,"end":357.91,"text":"The final subject area that I wish to bring to your attention is that of zoology. Once again,","words":[["The",350.97,351.69],["final",351.69,352.13],["subject",352.13,352.59],["area",352.59,353.01],["that",353.01,353.27],["I",353.27,353.43],["wish",353.43,353.63],["to",353.63,353.83],["bring",353.83,353.99],["to",353.99,354.15],["your",354.15,354.31],["attention",354.31,354.67],["is",354.67,355.31],["that",355.31,355.51],["of",355.51,355.67],["zoology.",355.67,356.37],["Once",357.11,357.53],["again,",357.53,357.91]]},{"start":358.27,"end":365.43,"text":"computers and technology have a key role to play here. Experts comment specifically on the","words":[["computers",358.27,358.67],["and",358.67,359.05],["technology",359.05,359.75],["have",359.75,360.09],["a",360.09,360.23],["key",360.23,360.51],["role",360.51,360.87],["to",360.87,361.11],["play",361.11,361.37],["here.",361.37,361.77],["Experts",362.65,363.37],["comment",363.37,363.73],["specifically",363.73,364.43],["on",364.43,365.29],["the",365.29,365.43]]},{"start":365.43,"end":371.73,"text":"importance of satellites for future developments in this field. These enable people to explore","words":[["importance",365.43,365.89],["of",365.89,366.19],["satellites",366.19,366.79],["for",366.79,367.19],["future",367.19,367.55],["developments",367.55,368.09],["in",368.09,368.37],["this",368.37,368.55],["field.",368.55,368.93],["These",369.73,370.11],["enable",370.11,370.63],["people",370.63,371.03],["to",371.03,371.27],["explore",371.27,371.73]]},{"start":371.73,"end":377.63,"text":"the world from their homes, offices and schools. It is now possible, for instance,","words":[["the",371.73,372.03],["world",372.03,372.33],["from",372.33,372.57],["their",372.57,372.75],["homes,",372.75,373.23],["offices",373.69,374.05],["and",374.05,374.61],["schools.",374.61,375.05],["It",375.95,376.23],["is",376.23,376.37],["now",376.37,376.57],["possible,",376.57,376.99],["for",377.23,377.37],["instance,",377.37,377.63]]},{"start":377.63,"end":383.61,"text":"to go online and see for yourself the abundant wildlife in one part of East Africa,","words":[["to",377.63,378.09],["go",378.09,378.27],["online",378.27,378.81],["and",378.81,379.31],["see",379.31,379.55],["for",379.55,379.75],["yourself",379.75,380.19],["the",380.19,380.45],["abundant",380.45,380.87],["wildlife",380.87,381.61],["in",381.61,382.01],["one",382.01,382.29],["part",382.29,382.69],["of",382.69,382.97],["East",382.97,383.21],["Africa,",383.21,383.61]]},{"start":383.97,"end":389.43,"text":"and in the surrounding region the harm people have done by destroying the forests,","words":[["and",383.97,384.55],["in",384.55,384.77],["the",384.77,384.95],["surrounding",384.95,385.51],["region",385.51,386.13],["the",386.13,386.67],["harm",386.67,387.11],["people",387.11,387.49],["have",387.49,387.75],["done",387.75,387.99],["by",387.99,388.21],["d